<title>JAPAN: Uniden - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Uniden - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 37.09		vs	   28.40</p>
<p> Operating	  386 million	 vs	    1.70</p>
<p> Current		3.05		vs	    4.08</p>
<p> Net		    1.48		vs	  903 million</p>
<p> EPS		   30.21 yen	  vs	   18.41 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     49 million	  vs	  49 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 12.50 yen	  vs	   12.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Uniden Corp manufactures mobile phones, cordless telephones and satellite broadcasting receivers.</p>
</text>
